  "description": "Western School is a bold vintage display font inspired by classic Western signage, old saloons, and retro collegiate typography. Featuring strong geometric letterforms with a timeless frontier aesthetic, this font is perfect for logos, posters, branding, packaging, apparel, and vintage-themed designs that demand attention.\nWhether you’re creating Western merchandise, cowboy-inspired graphics, sports branding, beer labels, restaurant menus, badges, stickers, T-shirts, or eye-catching headlines, Western School delivers a rugged yet clean appearance that stands out in both print and digital projects. Its bold structure and vintage charm make it an excellent choice for designers looking to add authentic Old West character to their work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Western School is a bold vintage display font inspired by classic Western signage, old saloons, and retro collegiate typography. Featuring strong geometric letterforms with a timeless frontier aesthetic, this font is perfect for logos, posters, branding, packaging, apparel, and vintage-themed designs that demand attention.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating Western merchandise, cowboy-inspired graphics, sports branding, beer labels, restaurant menus, badges, stickers, T-shirts, or eye-catching headlines, Western School delivers a rugged yet clean appearance that stands out in both print and digital projects. Its bold structure and vintage charm make it an excellent choice for designers looking to add authentic Old West character to their work.</p>",
